{"symbol":"NEETUYOSHI","yahoo":"NEETUYOSHI.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Neetu Yoshi Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Railroads","website":"https://www.neetuyoshi.com","about":"Neetu Yoshi Limited, a metallurgical engineering company engages in the manufacturing of customized products in various grades of ferrous metallurgical products in India. The company offers wagon components, such as CP assembly, striker casting, wedges, back stop, brake beam, yoke pin support plate, adaptors, and coupler assemblies; track components, including concrete railway sleeper and cast iron insert; and coach components consist of buffer assembly for coaches, various liners, coupler assemblies for coaches, side buffer, further coach components, axle box housing, and brake support; and cast and machined parts for locomotives. It also provides casting of bogie and railway track components for Indian railways; and manufacturing of food products and beverages. Its product portfolio covers various grades of mild steel, spheroidal graphite iron, cast iron, and manganese steel. Neetu Yoshi Limited was incorporated in 2020 and is based in Dehradun, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:43:34+00:00","quote":{"price":234.05,"prevClose":222.95,"marketCap":908.42,"high52":234.5,"low52":71.3,"pe":33.87,"bookValue":34.86,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":27.48,"shares":3.8813,"insiders":74.45,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-07-04","2025-07-07","2025-07-08","2025-07-09","2025-07-10","2025-07-11","2025-07-14","2025-07-15","2025-07-16","2025-07-17","2025-07-18","2025-07-21","2025-07-22","2025-07-23","2025-07-24","2025-07-25","2025-07-28","2025-07-29","2025-07-30","2025-07-31","2025-08-01","2025-08-04","2025-08-05","2025-08-06","2025-08-07","2025-08-08","2025-08-11","2025-08-12","2025-08-13","2025-08-14","2025-08-18","2025-08-19","2025-08-20","2025-08-21","2025-08-22","2025-08-25","2025-08-26","2025-08-28","2025-08-29","2025-09-01","2025-09-02","2025-09-03","2025-09-04","2025-09-05","2025